          "chunk_id": "s01_c03",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s01_c3_unlike_earlier_trajectory_datasets_c",
          "text": "Unlike earlier trajectory datasets captured from fixed rooftop cameras or from cars driving on separate roads, SiT was recorded by a mobile robot navigating densely populated indoor and outdoor spaces in downtown Seoul, capturing genuine human-robot interaction up close.",
