        {
          "chunk_index": 1,
          "chunk_id": "s02_c01",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s02_c1_robot_navigate_safely_among_people",
          "text": "For a robot to navigate safely among people, it needs to perceive nearby pedestrians as individual entities in three-dimensional space and predict where they will move next.",
