          "required": true
        },
        {
          "chunk_index": 2,
          "chunk_id": "s02_c02",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s02_c2_problem_datasets_used_train_these",
          "text": "The problem is that the datasets used to train these models don't reflect the robot's real situation.",
