          "chunk_index": 4,
          "chunk_id": "s02_c04",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s02_c4_large_autonomous_driving_datasets_pr",
          "text": "Large autonomous-driving datasets do provide rich sensor data, but there the vehicle and the pedestrians usually travel on separate roads and rarely come into close contact. Neither setting matches a robot weaving through a crowded hallway or crosswalk.",
          "expected_role": "method",
          "cue_keywords": [
