          "chunk_id": "s06_c04",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s06_c4_trajectory_prediction_takes_two_seco",
          "text": "Trajectory prediction takes two seconds of past motion and predicts seven seconds ahead, scored with average and final displacement error over the best of K candidate trajectories. And an end-to-end task runs from raw sensors all the way to future bounding boxes and trajectories.",
          "expected_role": "method",
