          "anchor_id": "cue_s07_c4_benchmark_itself_standout_finding_su",
          "text": "On the benchmark itself, the standout finding is that supplying the semantic map improves trajectory prediction: the best model, NSP-SFM with the map, reaches an ADE-twenty of about 0.52 and an FDE-twenty of about 0.93, clearly better than the same model without the map.",
